# Orange Logic

> Orange Logic provides enterprise digital asset management (DAM) and media asset management (MAM) software for organizations with complex content libraries, workflows, governance requirements, integrations, and global teams. Its platform supports content orchestration, AI-assisted asset management, metadata and taxonomy, workflow automation, digital rights management, brand portals, enterprise search, security, and scalable content operations.

Use the resources below to understand Orange Logic, its platform capabilities, industry applications, customer outcomes, technical documentation, and third-party analyst recognition.

## Company and Platform

- [Orange Logic](https://www.orangelogic.com/): Overview of Orange Logic and its enterprise digital asset management platform, including configurable team workspaces, content orchestration, AI-assisted asset management, governance, security, integrations, and scalable content operations.
- [About Orange Logic](https://www.orangelogic.com/About): Company background, mission, purpose, and history of Orange Logic, an enterprise digital asset management provider founded to solve complex digital archive and content management challenges for global organizations.
- [Enterprise Digital Asset Management Platform](https://www.orangelogic.com/digital-asset-management-software): Overview of Orange Logic's enterprise DAM platform for centralizing digital assets, connecting teams and workflows, improving search and discovery, managing usage rights, supporting media production, and scaling content operations across an organization.
- [Media Asset Management Platform](https://www.orangelogic.com/media-asset-management): Overview of Orange Logic's media asset management capabilities for storing, searching, editing, reviewing, transcoding, collaborating on, and distributing large video and rich-media files within an integrated DAM environment.

